# Beta-test harness output. run.js writes results.json relative to the CWD, so
# running it from the repo root rather than from .claude/betatest/ drops a
# multi-megabyte blob here — where nothing else ignores it, because the harness
# itself is covered by the .claude/ rule below. This repo already carries a
# known git-history bloat problem; it does not need probe output in it too.
results.json
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

